OL,3,GNEWSAEarly-release prisoners
OL,4,A'desperate', warns charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA homeless charity said it faced a
OL,7,Fnight of "chaos" after seeing an influx
OL,8,Fof people released early from prison as
OL,9,Fpart of the government's efforts to
OL,10,Fease overcrowding.
OL,12,FBecky Joyce, director and co-founder of
OL,13,FHomeless Street Angels in Leeds, said
OL,14,Fsome of those leaving prison had "come
OL,15,Fout to nothing" and had told her they
OL,16,Fwere considering re-offending to avoid
OL,17,Fhomelessness.
OL,19,FAround 700 people left prisons across
OL,20,FEngland and Wales under the early
OL,21,Fprisoner release plan on Thursday.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
