OL,3,GNEWSAEarly-release prisoners
OL,4,A'desperate', warns charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said prisons, probation
OL,7,Fand councils work together before
OL,8,Fprisoners are released to assess
OL,9,Fhousing need and that prisoners at risk
OL,10,Fof becoming homeless could be offered
OL,11,Fup to 12 weeks of basic accommodation.
